KONOHAGAKURE BINGO BOOK — MASTER INDEX
Issued under the authority of the Hokage's Office

Purpose: This registry catalogs missing-nin, hostile foreign operatives, and standing threats to the Land of Fire. Entries are assigned threat ranks (C through S) and standing bounties. Bounties are payable on verified confirmation of death or capture and delivery to a Konoha collection point.

Standing High-Priority Entries:
- Orochimaru — S-Rank — former Sannin, defector (see orochimaru_file)
- Itachi Uchiha — S-Rank — Uchiha massacre, Akatsuki
- Kisame Hoshigaki — S-Rank — Akatsuki, Samehada
- Sasuke Uchiha — reclassified, monitor (see sasuke_uchiha_file)
- "Tobi" — Unknown — suspected Akatsuki leadership

Distribution: Chunin and above. Field teams must verify current edition number before deployment; superseded editions are to be surrendered to the mission desk. Handling per bingo_book_update_procedure.

By order of the Godaime Hokage, Tsunade.
